{
  "name": "Turn Google Realtime Trending searches into OpenAI briefs in Sheets, Gmail, and Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Turn Google Realtime Trending searches into OpenAI briefs in Sheets, Gmail, and Slack\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow runs every six hours to extract fresh records through the **[google-trending-now-scraper](https://apify.com/unitbytes/google-trending-now-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io)** UnitBytes Apify actor ($0.00045 / item), remove previously seen items by `keyword`, and normalize and score the dataset (`keyword, volume, volume_growth_pct, geo`). It maps the cleaned fields for export, logs all rows to **Google Sheets**, creates a backup **CSV** file, and sends only high-priority records into **OpenAI (`gpt-4o-mini`)** for structured analysis and action drafting. The enriched fields are then merged and delivered to **Slack** and **Gmail**.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the schedule interval in **When Every 6 Hours** if six hours is not ideal for your cadence.\n- Add your Apify API token from [google-trending-now-scraper on Apify Store](https://apify.com/unitbytes/google-trending-now-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io) (`Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN>`) in **Post to Google Trending Now & Realtime Trends Scraper API** and confirm `actorInput` in **Set Search Parameters**.\n- Connect **Google Sheets** credentials in **Append Data to Sheets** and select your destination spreadsheet.\n- Configure **OpenAI** credentials in **AI SEO and Content Brief Strategist** and review the `gpt-4o-mini` system prompt.\n- Connect **Slack** and **Gmail** credentials on the final delivery nodes.\n- Review `minTrendValue` and `priorityKeyword` in **Set Search Parameters** before activating.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust `actorInput`, `minTrendValue`, `priorityKeyword`, the OpenAI prompt, Slack message formatting, and Gmail template fields to match your workflow. Full schema and input docs: [https://unitbytes.com/actors/google-trending-now-scraper/](https://unitbytes.com/actors/google-trending-now-scraper/)",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896
      },
      "id": "c45335a3-4371-5841-9cd2-30e3407a3478",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
